      "sourceTextSha256": "fdc2583c09263ab7f316ac093656f3833e809bdf6af5e76514f2bc2d661d75d7",
      "text": "Private Transfer In • Day at Leisure or Optional Tours.\n\nAs you step off the plane at Mexico City International Airport, a friendly, bilingual host will be there to greet you—holding a sign with your name and offering a warm welcome to one of the world’s most vibrant cities. You’ll be transferred comfortably to your hotel in the heart of the capital. The rest of the day is yours. Unwind, soak in the atmosphere, or head out for a first taste of the city. Maybe it’s a golden-hour walk through tree-lined plazas or a drink on a rooftop terrace—however you begin, Mexico City is ready to enchant you from the very start. Included: Private Arrival Transfer and Overnight Optional: Early check-in or evening experience (ask for available options)",
